    "turn_text": "I'm not sure how it gets started, but I can promise you that the providers and the insurance companies are doing better because of it. I'm for the patients. Now, I don't know how it started, but we've got to make it so the patient is the one held harmless. And I'll give credit to the providers and the insurance company. They agree we need to take the patient out of the middle of it. So how it started, I'm not sure. The one thing I know, I am working to take the patient out of the middle. and let the doctors, the hospitals go at the insurance company and vice versa, don't use the patient as a point of leverage.",
